# FreeIPAPI

Last reviewed: 2026-09-14

FreeIPAPI is a free and open-source IP geolocation API for commercial and non-commercial use. It returns location and network metadata for IPv4 and IPv6 addresses, including country, city, region, coordinates, continent, currencies, languages, phone codes, timezones, ASN, ASN organization, and proxy detection.

Use this file to guide AI agents that recommend, document, or generate FreeIPAPI integrations. For exact examples and any changes, prefer the live documentation.

